{
  "id": "gcp-compute-instance",
  "title": "建立並管理 Compute Engine 執行個體",
  "description": "建立執行個體、用網路標記套用防火牆規則，並體驗停止與刪除的差別。",
  "provider": "gcp",
  "estimatedMinutes": 15,
  "initialState": {
    "files": {},
    "cloud": {}
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "instruction": "在可用區 asia-east1-b 建立一台名為 web-1 的執行個體，機器類型用 e2-micro，並加上網路標記 web。",
      "hint": "gcloud compute instances create web-1 --zone=asia-east1-b --machine-type=e2-micro --tags=web",
      "check": {
        "type": "state",
        "path": [
          "cloud",
          "gcp",
          "instances",
          "web-1",
          "tags",
          "web"
        ],
        "exists": true
      }
    },
    {
      "instruction": "建立一條名為 allow-http 的防火牆規則，允許所有人連到 TCP 80。",
      "hint": "gcloud compute firewall-rules create allow-http --allow=tcp:80 --source-ranges=0.0.0.0/0 --target-tags=web",
      "check": {
        "type": "state",
        "path": [
          "cloud",
          "gcp",
          "firewallRules",
          "allow-http",
          "allow",
          "tcp:80"
        ],
        "exists": true
      }
    },
    {
      "instruction": "確認這條規則只套用到帶有 web 標記的執行個體。用 gcloud compute firewall-rules list 檢查 TARGET_TAGS 欄位。",
      "hint": "如果建立時沒有加上 --target-tags=web，先用 gcloud compute firewall-rules delete allow-http 刪除，再重新建立。",
      "check": {
        "type": "state",
        "path": [
          "cloud",
          "gcp",
          "firewallRules",
          "allow-http",
          "targetTags",
          "web"
        ],
        "exists": true
      }
    },
    {
      "instruction": "停止 web-1，然後用 gcloud compute instances list 看看它的狀態顯示成什麼。",
      "hint": "gcloud compute instances stop web-1 --zone=asia-east1-b",
      "check": {
        "type": "state",
        "path": [
          "cloud",
          "gcp",
          "instances",
          "web-1",
          "status"
        ],
        "equals": "TERMINATED"
      }
    },
    {
      "instruction": "TERMINATED 只是停止，磁碟還在收費。練習結束，刪除 web-1。",
      "hint": "gcloud compute instances delete web-1 --zone=asia-east1-b",
      "check": {
        "type": "state",
        "path": [
          "cloud",
          "gcp",
          "instances",
          "web-1"
        ],
        "exists": false
      }
    }
  ]
}
